{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Preserve `ThreadDeath` on Java 17.** The SDK targets Java 17, where `Thread.stop()` still terminates a thread by throwing `ThreadDeath`. Containing that throwable lets a forcibly stopped factory or hook thread continue into SDK/user work after its stack and invariants may have been disrupted. Re-throw `ThreadDeath` alongside `VirtualMachineError`, and add factory and hook regression tests that throw it directly.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7w815U","finding_digest":"7e3790cdee0d7c8a300f777309edfcee797a00eb9548b03bd52de77fecb27cfe","finding_id":"arf_v1_py3zbtpobv6iumapo5zqt3p45z","finding_key":"sdk/pluginrunner::dispatch::non-vm-error-isolation","identity_key":"sdk/pluginrunner::dispatch::non-vm-error-isolation","line":149,"observation_digest":"15ad47f3502c845f90600d2821456a88ef0c6babc0fe9fc695f7c0615b54adce","observation_id":"aro_v1_cwwup42qfscf7edabuuccrlkrd","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_py3zbtpobv6iumapo5zqt3p45z","published_at":"2026-09-18T00:11:03Z","review_id":"arr_v1_hw3qgj6fdbwy5muvzjruzgqo2z","reviewed_base_sha":"dd19d8efc275c4cf97e34338fff51f53957e42c6","reviewed_head_sha":"3cdec0315ed8c357223eadc5e9061d5f476d862e","reviewer":"codex","start_line":147,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":721},"record_id":"art_v1_yvljawf5ir6tdogu4jdacxlspw","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-18T00:11:03Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
